Source: gimp-rom-bin
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Maintainer: bbbbbr
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 7.0.50~), libgimp-3.0-dev
Standards-Version: 3.9.3

Package: gimp-rom-bin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gimp
Description: GIMP plug-in for reading and writing ROM images and tile files
 Reads, writes and converts console ROM images and tile files, which is
 useful for emulation ROM modding, hacks and extracting/inserting artwork.
 .
 Supports NES 1bpp/2bpp, SNES 2bpp/3bpp/4bpp/8bpp, GameBoy 2bpp, NGPC 2bpp,
 GBA 4bpp/8bpp, Game Gear/SMS/WSC 4bpp, Mega Drive 4bpp and Casio Loopy
 4bpp/8bpp.
 .
 This package builds against GIMP 3.x.
